  "description": "Pure C# GRIB2 decoder for .NET with support for Simple Packing, Complex Packing, IEEE Float, and bitmap-based missing values. JPEG2000 (template 5.40) is provided by the optional GribSharp.Jpeg2000 add-on package.",
